      <title>2026-06-26 世界杯早报：厄瓜多尔逆转德国成功出线 科特迪瓦队史首次出线</title>
      <link>https://m.zhibo8.com//news/web/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3d7ba8001ffnative.htm</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/match1869162date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">出线！厄瓜多尔2-1逆转德国 萨内破门普拉塔制胜女主裁判罚引争议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260626/zhanbao_image_1869162_1782424208_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260626/zhanbao_image_1869162_1782424208_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260626/zhanbao_image_1869162_1782424208_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>厄瓜多尔取首胜+4分确定出线！萨内破门，安古洛、普拉塔连入两球逆转。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/match1869163date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队史首次出线！科特迪瓦2-0库拉索 佩佩双响迪奥曼德桑加雷献助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260626/zhanbao_image_1869163_1782423665_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260626/zhanbao_image_1869163_1782423665_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260626/zhanbao_image_1869163_1782423665_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>科特迪瓦队史首次世界杯出线！尼古拉·佩佩梅开二度，迪奥曼德、桑加雷献助攻。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3da239402f0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">时隔20年出线！厄瓜多尔锁定8个最好成绩小组第3，晋级世界杯32强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da425ba502.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da425ba502.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da425ba502.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯小组赛E组第3轮，厄瓜多尔2-1战胜德国，最终排名小组第三，已经锁定8个成绩最好的小组第三之一，晋级世界杯32强。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3d78cc74301native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创历史！科特迪瓦队史首次世界杯小组出线，将战法国或挪威</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da25458c99.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da25458c99.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da25458c99.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛E组第3轮，科特迪瓦2-0战胜库拉索，队史首次晋级世界杯淘汰赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3da257cd576native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">E组最终积分榜：德国头名科特迪瓦厄瓜多尔2、3出线 库拉索出局</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260600216279.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260600216279.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260600216279.jpg"> </div><p>德国队小组凭借胜负关系头名出线晋级32强，科特迪瓦小组第2出线，厄瓜多尔也确认晋级最好8个最好的小组第3，库拉索小组第4出局。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3d9d8b29dabnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯已15队进32强：科特迪瓦小组第2出线，厄瓜多尔小组3晋级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da64c20b21.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da64c20b21.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3da64c20b21.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛E组，德国小组第一出线，科特迪瓦小组第二晋级，厄瓜多尔也以小组第三出线。截至目前，世界杯已有15队出线。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3da38fb83a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德国淘汰赛潜在对手：日荷瑞典所在F组第3 韩国、波黑、苏格兰 D3</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260554408734.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260554408734.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260554408734.jpg"> </div><p>德国淘汰赛将面对A3/B3/C3/D3/F3其中一个对手。目前已确定A3为韩国，B3为波黑，C3为苏格兰，D3和F3还未决出，目前D3可能是澳大利亚或巴拉圭，F3可能是荷兰、日本或瑞典。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3da6d4851e7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">10进6！小组第三积分榜：厄瓜多尔、波黑锁定出线，韩国跌至第5！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260608437011.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260608437011.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260608437011.jpg"> </div><p>在小组第三名排行榜上，厄瓜多尔、波黑已经锁定出线，剩下10支球队争夺6个出线名额。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3daa792af16native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">昨天曾高达94%！TA更新韩国出线概率：跌至86%，争夺剩余6个名额</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.23" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260625572670.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.23" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.23" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260625572670.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260625572670.jpg"> </div><p>厄瓜多尔2-1逆转德国锁定8个成绩最好的小组第三之一，比赛结束后，TA更新了韩国队的出线概率。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3d8d9c50c5bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">抬脚过高未判！德国vs厄瓜多尔判罚引热议：误判！VAR在做什么？</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3d8b880a900_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3d8b880a900.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/6a3d8b880a900.jpg"> </div><p>德国vs厄瓜多尔开场2分钟，维尔茨助攻萨内破门，德国1-0领先厄瓜多尔。回放显示，进球过程中帕夫洛维奇抬脚过高踢到了对手头部，但是女主裁无表示，VAR没有介入。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3da4213bd46native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">连场争议！德国vs厄瓜多尔女主裁，此前捷克vs南非也曾判争议点球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a343033ce1da.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a343033ce1da.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260619/6a343033ce1da.jpg"> </div><p>德国vs厄瓜多尔，主裁判托里·彭索的判罚引起争议。她上一场吹罚捷克vs南非，也曾出现判罚引起争议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3d68fef3612native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">结束10年国家队生涯！捷克官方：30岁希克从国家队退役</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260145441327.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260145441327_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260626/202606260145441327_720.jpg"> </div><p>捷克国家队官方消息，30岁前锋希克决定从国家队退役，结束10年国家队生涯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-26/6a3d9d15a836enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">埃杜：阿根廷末轮将轮换出战，阿尔瓦雷斯、洛塞尔索将首发</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398c2f56971_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398c2f56971.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398c2f56971.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷跟队记者埃杜透露，在连胜锁定头名后，阿根廷末轮将轮换出战。</p><p><a href="https://news.z